.TH PICNEST 1 "October 2026" "Picnest 1.0.7" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
picnest \- modern photo and video gallery for GNOME
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B picnest
[\fIFILE\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Picnest
automatically finds every photo and video on all internal drives and mounted
external drives and presents them in one organized library with days, months
and years views, albums, favorites, folders, memories, smart collections,
instant search, a full screen viewer, a video player and a basic editor.
.PP
When files are given on the command line, Picnest adds them to the library and
opens them in the viewer.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/picnest/picnest.conf
System-wide list of paths and folder names that are never scanned.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/picnest/library.db
The media index, favorites, albums and other library data.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/picnest/thumbnails
Cached thumbnails.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B PICNEST_DEBUG
Enable debug logging when set.
.TP
.B PICNEST_SCAN_ROOTS
Colon separated list of folders to scan instead of the configured locations.
.SH AUTHOR
Created by Junaid Ul Hassan, Software Engineer.
